flowchart TD
  cart[Server cart containing one or more shops] --> lock[Lock the product rows in product id order]
  lock --> check{Every line is purchasable and has stock}
  check -->|No| fail[Roll back and return the failing lines]
  check -->|Yes| parent[Insert one parent order]
  parent --> split[Insert one merchant sub-order per shop]
  split --> items[Insert order items with name and unit price snapshots]
  items --> decrement[Decrement stock and set the hold to HELD]
  decrement --> pay{Payment method}
  pay -->|Chapa| onePay[Insert one payment for the parent grand total]
  pay -->|Bank transfer| manyPay[Insert one payment for each sub-order total]
  onePay --> clear[Clear the cart and commit]
  manyPay --> clear
  clear --> after{Method}
  after -->|Chapa| chapa[Initialize Chapa after the commit]
  after -->|Bank transfer| banks[Return each merchant bank instruction to the customer]
